IDEA 1227 (cloud lane, 2026-09-17) — should PROTOCOL require a COUNT-MATCHED NULL
beside EVERY chooser claim?
============================================================================================================
PROTOCOL: costs 10 bps, decide-at-t / apply-at-t+1, warm-up 260 rows,
rule-8 walk-forward — every fold decision reads only data before that fold, OOS folds
2017-2026 read once.  Both KEEP paths.  All 12 grid points published.

