  NL_PERM IS THE ONE THAT BITES, AND IT BITES EVERYTHING.  It holds the rule's move
  COUNT and its DESTINATIONS fixed and randomises only WHEN the moves happen: 0 of 8
  naive passes survive it.  So the whole published gain of this rule family is a
  property of fold TIMING, not of the rungs the rule reads or how often it moves.

